{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Array/Lex/Basic.html#Array.lex.go\"><span class=\"name\">Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">lex</span>.<span class=\"name\">go</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq\">BEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">as </span><span class=\"fn\">bs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lt</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Array/Lex/Basic.html#Array.lex.go","kind":"def","line":31,"name":"Array.lex.go","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Data/Array/Lex/Basic.lean#L31-L41"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Array/Lex/Basic.html#Array.lex\"><span class=\"name\">Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">lex</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq\">BEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">as </span><span class=\"fn\">bs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lt</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span> := by exact (· &lt; ·))</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Compares arrays lexicographically with respect to a comparison `lt` on their elements.\n\nSpecifically, `Array.lex as bs lt` is true if\n* `bs` is larger than `as` and `as` is pairwise equivalent via `==` to the initial segment of `bs`,\n  or\n* there is an index `i` such that `lt as[i] bs[i]`, and for all `j < i`, `as[j] == bs[j]`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Array/Lex/Basic.html#Array.lex","kind":"def","line":20,"name":"Array.lex","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Data/Array/Lex/Basic.lean#L20-L41"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Array.Basic","Init.Omega","Init.WFTactics"],"instances":[],"name":"Init.Data.Array.Lex.Basic"}